   "zh-Hant": "流光編年史",
   "ko": "루미너스 크로니클",
   "note": "DECIDED 2026-09-29. EN keeps \"Luminous Chronicle\" (EN logo: assets/title/logo_en). zh uses a meaning-based title, not the transliteration 路米纳斯编年史: 流光 = \"flowing light\" and, classically, \"the passing of time\" (流光易逝), so it carries both Luminous and Chronicle; four-plus-three characters read like established zh titles of localized JRPGs, are searchable on Steam, and avoid the generic 光之… pattern. Check trademark/store-name collisions with the publisher before release."
  },
